-- DevAdminMenu.lua
-- Put this as a LocalScript inside StarterPlayer.StarterPlayerScripts (or run it once via the command bar).
--
-- A draggable, closable debug menu for testing your bosses + player movement.
-- Covers:
--   * Zenithega  -- full Health control (via the real TakeDamage pipeline, so phases
--                   and the health bar stay correct) + a Kill button that also wipes
--                   every in-flight attack/coroutine/connection so you don't get combo'd
--                   by leftover hits after "death."
--   * Sagat WIPPP -- this boss module doesn't expose Health/TakeDamage at all (confirmed
--                   live -- it only has Win/ResetBoss/StopEverything/PreloadBoss), so its
--                   panel uses those instead of a health bar.
--   * Player      -- WalkSpeed, JumpHeight, Noclip, Infinite Jump, quick respawn.
--
-- Written after inspecting the live boss modules and Humanoid properties directly, not
-- guessed from the script text alone, so field names below are confirmed to exist.

